        "text_nDR7r7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Textile history dates back to the beginning of human civilization.</p><p>Hartwick Atelier specializes in hand spun and handwoven fabrics, natural and ayurvedic dyes, and detailed handwork. These artisanal techniques rely on rare knowledge and the natural cycles of the sun, wind and rain.</p><p>Each handcrafted piece in the collection is a glimpse into the rich history, intricate process and generations of skill that have gone into its creation.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-std",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text_indent": "noindent"
          }
        }
      },
