          "settings": {
            "heading": "A World of Happenings",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "text_6GerBb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every handwoven fabric holds a story of natural fibres, picked and spun into thread by hand then loaded on a loom, where the rhythm and vision of a weaver manifests in the fabric itself.</p><p>Every shade of natural color is a reflection of a season’s delicate balance of rainfall, sun and wind.</p><p>Each block print started as a tree, then a wood block, carved by hand into sets of intricate patterns, dipped and stamped layer by layer, revealing ancient motifs of Earth and sky.</p><p>Each brilliant gem - a piece of the Earth herself - is held in place by precious metals, moulded by fire at the hands of craftsmen whose skill has been refined over generations.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-std",
            "alignment": "center",
            "text_indent": "noindent"
          }
        },
        "button_wayBV4": {
